# Reach a RUNNING city, headlessly. Verified 2026-09-30.
#
# T118 variant of scripts/d_city.script: inserts a diagnostic poke of WRAM
# $0012 = 1 at frame ~3000, BEFORE the natural f3271 latch.
#
# The poke reproduces the 16-bit store at $03:D2AA (STA $0012 = 1), written
# as two separate 8-bit pokes: poke 0012 01 then poke 0013 00.
#
# > THIS IS A DIAGNOSTIC POKE. It must never make make clock pass (DoD Rule 0).
# > scripts/check-cheat-gate.sh is green with this file present. No gate script
# > invokes it. It is a measurement tool only.
#
# Full data: docs/measurements/2026-10-03-t118-0012-early-poke.md
wait 250
press start 5
wait 120
press down 5
wait 120
press b 5
wait 120
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 90
press b 5
wait 300
press left 5
wait 150
press down 5
wait 90
mouseclick right 6
wait 200
press down 5
wait 90
mouseclick right 6
wait 200
press down 5
wait 90
mouseclick right 6
wait 200
press down 5
wait 90
mouseclick right 6
# T118: poke $0012 = 1 at ~f3000, well before the natural f3271 latch.
# Inserted immediately after the 4th mouseclick (base frame f2923).
# wait 77 positions the first poke at f2923+77 = f3000.
wait 77
poke 0012 01
wait 5
poke 0013 00
wait 5
wait 600
